sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Training Operator Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS (auto-rotated)
    participant Controller as Training Operator Controller<br/>(opendatahub namespace)
    participant DNS as Kubernetes DNS<br/>53/UDP
    participant Master as Training Pod (Master)<br/>Framework port/TCP
    participant Worker as Training Pod (Worker)<br/>Framework port/TCP
    participant HPA as HPA Controller<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,Worker: Flow 1: Training Job Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: POST training job CR<br/>Auth: User credentials<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-kubeflow-org-v1-*<br/>Auth: API server client cert<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS (auto-rotated)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created / rejected

    Note over Controller,Worker: Controller reconciliation loop

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (new CR)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Pods (Master + Workers)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create headless Service<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+

    Note over Master,Worker: Pod-to-pod communication (plaintext)

    Worker->>Master: Connect via headless Service<br/>Framework port/TCP<br/>Plaintext (no TLS)

    Note over User,HPA: Flow 2: PyTorch Elastic Training

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over DNS,Worker: PyTorch init container waits for master
        Worker->>DNS: DNS lookup for master pod<br/>53/UDP plaintext
        DNS-->>Worker: Master pod IP
        Worker->>Master: c10d rendezvous<br/>23456/TCP plaintext

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HPA<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
        HPA->>K8sAPI: Scale workers based on metrics<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    end

    Note over User,HPA: Flow 3: MPI Job Execution

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create SA, Role, RoleBinding, ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
        Note over Master,Worker: MPI Launcher executes into workers
        Master->>K8sAPI: kubectl exec into Workers<br/>Auth: Per-job SA token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI->>Worker: Exec session (rsh)<br/>Kubernetes exec API TLS 1.2+
    end
